## Import

VM policies can be imported using the policy ID:

```bash
terraform import cyberarksia_vm_policy.example <policy_id>
```

**Note**: All principals assigned to the policy at import time will become inline principals in your Terraform state. For brownfield adoption where principals are managed externally, consider using `cyberarksia_vm_policy_principal_assignment` resources after import.

